%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor 用户 as U
    participant 微信小程序 as MP
    participant AppCustomController as CC
    participant 订单与定制服务 as SVC
    participant MySQL as DB

    U->>MP: 选择选项并填写内容与收货信息
    MP->>CC: POST /api/app/custom/create
    CC->>SVC: 创建定制单事务
    SVC->>DB: INSERT cl_order + items
    SVC->>DB: 计算排队并 INSERT cl_custom_order
    DB-->>SVC: OK
    SVC-->>CC: orderId, queueNo, queuePosition, estimatedTime
    CC-->>MP: AjaxResult
    MP-->>U: 排队卡片
